mode: "100644"
text: "# Funnel, scripts + two worked examples\n\n## The comment → DM → email funnel (architecture)\n```\n1. TRIGGER POST (WoopSocial publishes): Reel/carousel/caption -> \"Comment KEYWORD and I'll DM you [magnet].\"\n2. TRIGGER FIRES: follower comments the keyword (= explicit opt-in).\n3. WARM DM (official-API tool or human): deliver the magnet + one warm question. (within 24h)\n4. CAPTURE: ask for the email in-chat to send the full thing / next resource.\n5. QUALIFY + ROUTE: high-intent -> human; everyone -> email nurture (-> email-and-newsletter).\n```\nCompress any promo into the 24h window; the relationship continues by **email**, not endless DMs.\n\n## DM sequence template (warm, one question each)\n```\nDM1 (deliver): \"Hey [name]! Here's the [magnet] 👉 [link]. Quick Q: what are you stuck on with [topic]?\"\nDM2 (relate): respond to their answer with one genuinely useful tip. (no pitch yet)\nDM3 (capture/next): \"Want the full [resource]? Drop your email and I'll send it + a weekly note.\"\nDM4 (soft offer, only if warm + in-window): one clear next step. Then move to email.\n```\nFirst message: **no link-shortener**, ideally the link only after they engage; **one** link max.\n\n## Manual warm / partnership outreach script (sent by a human)\n```\n\"Hi [name] — your [specific thing they made] on [topic] was the clearest take I've seen. \nI'm [you], I [one-line value]. Would it make sense to [soft, specific ask]?\"\n```\nPersonalize the first line (+40% response); no \"Hey!\"; no link in msg 1; respect \"email only\" bios;\ndisclose partnerships **publicly** (comment/caption), not just in DM.\n\n## Safety checklist (avoid the ~12 ban triggers)\n[ ] only opted-in/warm recipients [ ] official Meta API tool (no scraping/password) [ ] vary message\ntext (no identical >25/hr) [ ] one link max, no shorteners [ ] within the 24h window [ ] no spam words\n[ ] visible opt-out, keep opt-out <4% [ ] route high-intent to a human.\n\n## Worked example 1 — comment→DM lead magnet (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nTRIGGER POST: \"Most freelancers overpay tax. Comment TAX and I'll DM you my 1-page checklist.\" (WoopSocial publishes)\nDM1: \"Here's the checklist 👉 [link]. What's the bit of tax that trips you up most?\"\nCAPTURE: \"Want the full system + a weekly note? Drop your email.\" -> email-and-newsletter\nSAFETY: official-API tool, varied text, one link. METRICS from the tool.\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 — story-reply re-engagement (warm studio voice)\n```\nTRIGGER: someone replies to a Story poll (\"which tax task do you dread?\") = opt-in.\nDM1: \"Thanks for voting 💛 Sounds like [their pick] is the headache. Want the one step that fixes it?\"\nDM2 (on reply): deliver the step. CAPTURE: offer the full guide for their email. ROUTE: if they ask about services -> human.\nWINDOW: all within 24h; after that, continue by email only.\n```\n\nBoth: opt-in only; warm + fast + one question; value before offer; email capture in-window; official-API\ntool or manual; metrics from the tool (never fabricated). WoopSocial only publishes the trigger posts.\n"
